/* The Spanish twin imported these three and this page imported none of them; dev hid it, because
   Vite keeps every stylesheet the session has already pulled in. `details.css` was missing on BOTH
   pages — the "Details nativo" stage rendered as bare <details> with the browser's own marker,
   since a preview frame only ever copies the styles its PAGE loaded. */
